# The fence covers point writes only. Batch appends carry no author stamp - the
# shape of the shard fold's serial-turn guard, which excludes point writes and
# only counts batches - so a batch admitted before the close is accepted after it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestDrainPointOnly
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: batch appends bypass the author fence, so the close drains point writes only
PERTURBS: ForeignAlloc, ForeignReject

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp >= fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
\* MUTATION: a batch append is not checked.
    /\ (fkind = "batch" \/ fstamp >= fFence)
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp < fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
    /\ fkind = "point"
    /\ fstamp < fFence
--- END
